.TH CLT 1
.SH NAME
clt \\- find hidden executable hash twins
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B clt
clt [--root DIRECTORY] [--quarantine-dir DIRECTORY] [--apply]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Correlates hidden executables with identical content. Moving candidates requires --apply.
.SH OPTIONS
Use \fBclt --help\fR for the complete, version-specific flag list.
.SH EXIT STATUS
Uses the shared CLI status convention: 0 success, 1 a completed negative finding or policy failure, 2 invalid usage, 3 a partial result, and 4 a runtime failure. Not every status applies to every command.
